{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/lem-fai-projector-coadjoint-orbit","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Lemma","doco:Section"],"label":"lem:fai-projector-coadjoint-orbit","kind":"lemma","title":"Rank-1 projectors embed $\\mathbb{P}(V)$ as a coadjoint orbit in $\\mathrm{Ad}(A)$","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-involutive-structure"],"proofs":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prf-fai-projector-coadjoint-orbit"],"tags":["rank-one-projector","coadjoint-orbit","involution","categorical-trace"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.fai_projector_coadjoint_orbit","text":"fai-projector-coadjoint-orbit.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"lem:fai-projector-coadjoint-orbit\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">V \\in \\mathbf{C}</code> be the standard representation, and let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\rho \\colon V \\to V</code> be a rank-1 projector. The traceless component <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma(\\rho) = \\rho - \\tfrac{1}{2}\\mathrm{id}_V \\in \\mathrm{Ad}(A)</code> satisfies the involution <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(2\\sigma(\\rho))^2 = \\mathrm{id}_V</code>. This map <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma</code> identifies <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbb{P}(V) \\cong G/T</code> with a closed coadjoint orbit in <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{Ad}(A)</code>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/fai-projector-coadjoint-orbit.md","heading":"Lemma","number":"4.6.4","page":"b/lem-fai-projector-coadjoint-orbit","qa":{"counts":{"pass":91,"fail":0,"warn":1,"na":13,"unknown":0,"stale":80},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":1}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.Core.fai_projector_coadjoint_orbit","via":"ref","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Core/fai_projector_coadjoint_orbit.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
